      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I see on multiple avatars with hairscaling animations (scales the x,y,z of a single bone early in the chain) very weird behaviour as well. On her example (i marked the bone with the script yellow and the scaled bone red), the scaled one gets stuck at the max angle limit from its parent. \nI will also attach two screenshots in debug mode from vrchat, where you can see the behaviour as well (one showing all physbones, to show that there is no colliding going on, the other only proximity to have a better look at the hair going upwards)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
